  "body": "As the result of `navigator.hid.requestDevice()` is a sequence of HID devices, it would be better for expectation purposes to rename the `navigator.hid` method to `requestDevices()`.\r\n\r\nNote that we have `getDevices()`, not `getDevice()`.\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst devices = await navigator.hid.requestDevices({ filters: [] });\r\ndevices.forEach((device) => { /* ... */ });\r\n```",
